      "id": "anno_lines",
      "x": 785,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 115,
      "text": "These are the invoice line items —\nthe rows in the detail grid.\n\nThey live INSIDE the InvoiceView\nas a List<InvoiceLineView>.\n\nNot a separate call. Not a\nseparate object. Part of the whole.",
